      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('这次我们先确认它代表什么，再决定能不能改。继续核对实验定义和实现以后，64 被确认只是实现层的容量限制；实验没有把 64 设成模型学习能力的科学上限。', 'We first checked what the limit meant before changing it. After checking the experiment definition and implementation, 64 was confirmed to be an implementation capacity limit; the experiment had not defined 64 as a scientific ceiling on learning.')}</p>
      <div class="capacity-pivot-grid">
