      <ol class="diagnostic-steps">
        <li><span>01</span><strong>{t('先看失败轨迹和训练日志', 'Inspect failed traces and training logs first')}</strong></li>
        <li><span>02</span><strong>{t('看到 15 步走满后仍在 next / back 里打转', 'Find 15-step traces still looping through next / back')}</strong></li>
        <li><span>03</span><strong>{t('看到 Text Memory 汇总 20 条记录时撞到 2048-token 上限', 'Find Text Memory hitting the 2048-token cap while summarizing 20 records')}</strong></li>
        <li><span>04</span><strong>{t('分别只改一个条件：15 → 30；2048 → 4096；仍饱和再 10 + 10', 'Change one condition at a time: 15 → 30; 2048 → 4096; if still saturated, 10 + 10')}</strong></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="diagnostic-branch-grid">
        <article>
          <span>{t('第一个问题', 'First issue found in the logs')}</span>
          <h3>{t('有些失败任务把 15 步全部走完，却一直在 next / back 等几个导航动作里绕', 'Some failures consume all 15 steps while looping through next / back and a few navigation actions')}</h3>
          <p>{t('所以当时第一个自然怀疑是：模型会不会能做，只是 15 步太短，还没来得及走到 buy？', 'The first natural hypothesis was therefore: maybe the model can solve the task but 15 steps are simply too short to reach buy.')}</p>
          <div><strong>15 → 30</strong><em>{t('只把最大交互步数翻倍，看行为会不会真正打开新路径', 'double only the interaction horizon and see whether behavior actually opens a new path')}</em></div>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span>{t('第二个问题', 'Second issue found in the logs')}</span>
          <h3>{t('Text Memory 在汇总 20 条记录时会撞到一次生成的 2048-token 上限', 'Text Memory summarization of 20 records hits the 2048-token generation cap')}</h3>
          <p>{t('所以另一个怀疑是：经验可能没有被完整整理进记忆，后面的模型拿到的是被截断的总结。', 'The other hypothesis was that experience was not being fully consolidated into memory, leaving later rounds with a truncated summary.')}</p>
          <div><strong>2048 → 4096 → 10+10</strong><em>{t('先加容量；仍饱和后才改成有边界的分块恢复', 'increase capacity first; only after saturation remains, switch to bounded decomposition')}</em></div>
