      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('15 → 30 已经排除了“只是时间不够”。下一步才把动作选择提示单独拿出来测，避免把步数、prompt 和 parser 一次全改掉。', 'The 15 → 30 test had already ruled out “just needs more time.” Only then did we isolate action-selection prompting while keeping the horizon and parser fixed.')}</p>
      <ol class="prompt-chain-grid">
        <li><span>01</span><div><strong>{t('把“别一直翻页”写成具体动作规则', 'Turn “stop paging” into concrete action rules')}</strong><p>{t('状态感知 prompt（state-aware-v3）：Search 一次；结果页先点一个合理商品；连续 Next 最多 2 次；商品页先选必要选项再 buy now；有别的合法动作时不要重复同一动作。', 'The state-aware-v3 prompt says: search once; prefer a plausible product before paging; allow at most two consecutive Next actions; select required options before buy now; and avoid repeating the same action when another legal action exists.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>02</span><div><strong>{t('第一次测试确实把一个任务从循环带到了购买', 'The first test did move one task from looping to purchase')}</strong><p>{t('H1.8 共 128 次尝试。带已有 success adapter 的模型 + state-aware-v3 在一个 cell 里得到 4 / 16 条正向结果，而且都来自同一个任务 3396；其它 cell 都是 0 / 16。', 'H1.8 ran 128 attempts. The existing success adapter + state-aware-v3 produced 4 / 16 positives in one cell, all on task 3396; every other cell was 0 / 16.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>03</span><div><strong>{t('换一批随机种子，还是只救回同一个任务', 'New seeds reproduced the rescue on the same task only')}</strong><p>{t('H1.9 用两组独立 seeds 复验：state-aware-v3 + success adapter 一共得到 8 条正向结果，全部仍是任务 3396；compact prompt 和 BASE 对照都是 0。', 'H1.9 repeated with two independent seed blocks: state-aware-v3 + the success adapter produced eight positives, again all on task 3396; compact-prompt and BASE controls stayed at zero.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>04</span><div><strong>{t('换到新任务后，prompt 优势没有选择性迁移', 'On new tasks, the prompt advantage was not selective')}</strong><p>{t('H1.10 的新任务里出现了正向结果，但不同 arm 也出现同类正向结果。于是判断变成：这个 prompt 能改变轨迹、能救回特定任务，但不能当成全局低分的通用解释。', 'H1.10 produced positives on new tasks, but they appeared across multiple arms and showed no selective state-aware-v3 advantage. The judgment therefore changed: the prompt can change trajectories and rescue a specific task, but it is not a general explanation for the low score.')}</p></div></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="prompt-chain-conclusion"><strong>{t('最后保留的科学结论', 'Scientific takeaway')}</strong>{t('不把“禁止 next / back”硬塞进原实验；把状态感知 prompt 当作独立变量来测。它提供了局部行为证据，但没有解决广泛泛化问题。', 'Do not hard-code a next / back ban into the original experiment; test a state-aware prompt as its own variable. It produced local behavioral evidence without solving broad generalization.')}</p>
