  <section id="directapply" class="briefing-slide tone-green" aria-labelledby="directapply-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <h2 id="directapply-title">{t('我们从相同条件启动 DirectApply，对照 GDR 是否太保守', 'We started DirectApply from matched conditions to test whether GDR is too conservative')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('两条线尽量保持同一个冻结起点、数据条件和 SD-LoRA 训练规则。DirectApply 只取消短期 task-score probe 对候选生死的决定权；数据合同、工程安全和 determinism 检查仍然保留。', 'The two lines keep the same frozen start, data conditions, and SD-LoRA training rule as closely as possible. DirectApply removes only the short task-score probe’s accept/reject authority; data contracts, engineering safety, and determinism checks remain.')}</p>
