      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('这些技术工作分别保护一种实验性质：知道结果来自哪份代码、确认两组真的只差一个变量、机器中断后不重跑，以及加速时不偷偷改变科学语义。', 'Each engineering layer protects a different experimental property: knowing exactly which code produced a result, keeping comparisons one-variable, resuming without replay, and speeding up without silently changing scientific semantics.')}</p>
      <ol class="technical-proof-grid">
        <li><span>01</span><div><strong>{t('为了可追溯', 'Traceability')}</strong><p>{t('每次运行绑定 Git commit SHA、config / payload SHA256、W&B run identity 和 ledger receipt。拿到一个数字，可以一路追到实际代码与数据。', 'Bind every run to a Git commit SHA, config / payload SHA256, W&B run identity, and ledger receipts so a number can be traced back to its code and data.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>02</span><div><strong>{t('为了公平比较', 'Causal comparability')}</strong><p>{t('冻结起点、seed、任务顺序和 treatment identity；固定 GPU 的 determinism 检查用于确认重复执行不会把硬件漂移误当成方法差异。', 'Freeze starts, seeds, task order, and treatment identity; fixed-GPU determinism checks prevent hardware drift from masquerading as a method difference.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>03</span><div><strong>{t('为了中断后还能原地继续', 'Recoverability')}</strong><p>{t('Checkpoint、archive、transaction receipt、resume / recovery 连在一起；恢复前核对 state SHA，避免把已经完成的 rollout 再消费一次。', 'Checkpoint, archive, transaction receipts, resume, and recovery are chained together; state SHAs are checked before recovery so completed rollouts are not consumed twice.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>04</span><div><strong>{t('为了排除动作接口这个隐藏变量', 'Action-interface validity')}</strong><p>{t('Harness、parser、ActionPrefixConstraint 和 injective action encoding 把“模型不会做”与“动作格式坏了”分开。', 'Harness, parser, ActionPrefixConstraint, and injective action encoding separate model failure from a broken action interface.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>05</span><div><strong>{t('为了长跑不被实现细节卡住', 'Long-run continuity')}</strong><p>{t('SD-LoRA component capacity 做单独资格验证；解除 64-component 工程上限时保持其他实验合同不动。', 'Qualify SD-LoRA component capacity separately; remove the 64-component implementation cap while leaving the rest of the experiment contract unchanged.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>06</span><div><strong>{t('为了加速但不改科学语义', 'Safe speedup')}</strong><p>{t('Ray 多模型并行、resource-only handoff 和 formal rollout replay = 0 的恢复检查，让 GPU 调度可以优化，同时保留同一实验身份。', 'Ray multi-model parallelism, resource-only handoffs, and formal-rollout-replay = 0 checks let scheduling improve while preserving the same scientific identity.')}</p></div></li>
      </ol>
